WEBVTT

00:15.530 --> 00:17.370
The time has come!

00:17.370 --> 00:21.060
Let the team tournament semifinal...

00:21.060 --> 00:23.120
...begin!

00:23.120 --> 00:24.620
Let's go!

00:29.050 --> 00:31.300
Just you wait, Viole.

00:31.300 --> 00:33.060
I promise...

00:39.260 --> 00:42.020
I'll bring you back!

02:11.980 --> 02:15.990
<b>Episode 22</b>

02:11.980 --> 02:15.990
<b>Their Workshop</b>

02:16.680 --> 02:19.880
Black turtle, black turtle, black turtle...

02:22.780 --> 02:23.490
What are you—

02:29.820 --> 02:32.250
Look at this heap of cash.

02:32.870 --> 02:34.500
Yes!

02:34.860 --> 02:36.760
It's burning time.

02:38.910 --> 02:41.390
I'll handle these guys.

02:41.390 --> 02:43.640
Hey, don't forget about me.

02:44.160 --> 02:45.850
I'm here, too.

02:48.010 --> 02:48.880
Let's go.

02:48.880 --> 02:51.150
Wait! Those guys are human kindling!

02:54.400 --> 02:57.780
I'll be your opponent!

02:59.780 --> 03:03.450
That was a feeble punch, little gator!

03:08.720 --> 03:10.920
Don't blame me...

03:11.350 --> 03:12.750
if you burn to a crisp!

03:20.220 --> 03:23.070
Your flames are delicious.

03:23.070 --> 03:24.050
What the...

03:24.050 --> 03:30.410
Ever heard of a clan living at the base of 
a volcano whose people consume fire?

03:30.410 --> 03:31.450
No way...

03:31.940 --> 03:33.940
Keep your eyes on me!

03:38.950 --> 03:40.360
Now, then...

03:40.360 --> 03:46.450
The snake woman said she'd pay us to 
kill you, but you're quite the looker.

03:47.830 --> 03:52.010
What do you say? In exchange for sparing you...

03:53.010 --> 03:54.080
Move.

03:55.330 --> 03:57.090
You pervert turtle.

04:00.050 --> 04:02.800
<i>Run! Focus on your role!</i>

04:02.800 --> 04:03.880
Got it!

04:18.520 --> 04:21.460
You must be Beta. I've been waiting for you.

04:21.460 --> 04:23.720
I am Devil Bon of FUG.

04:23.720 --> 04:24.810
Is that it?

04:24.810 --> 04:30.120
Yes. This is the first member 
of our team, Medina the Regular.

04:31.770 --> 04:36.700
They participated in the first round of 
the tournament by inhabiting a host.

04:37.060 --> 04:39.910
Our foolish opponents believed 
they'd defeated them,

04:39.910 --> 04:41.630
but as you can see, they're alive.

04:41.630 --> 04:46.640
By swallowing this and becoming their host,
you can participate in the game.

04:46.640 --> 04:52.590
However, if they take control of you,
you could lose yourself or become their puppet.

04:58.320 --> 04:59.210
Let's go.

05:00.230 --> 05:02.810
Uh... You feel perfectly fine?

05:10.160 --> 05:13.410
How'd he get bigger?

05:13.410 --> 05:15.790
I didn't get bigger.

05:15.790 --> 05:18.750
I returned to my normal size!

05:21.020 --> 05:23.440
He's strong. We'll take him on together.

05:23.440 --> 05:24.670
Yeah.

05:24.670 --> 05:28.180
That umbrella sure is hard.

05:28.510 --> 05:30.770
Hey, fire turtle. Use your flames.

05:30.770 --> 05:32.310
But he'll just eat them.

05:32.310 --> 05:35.180
Doesn't matter.
 Blast them as hard as you can.

05:37.690 --> 05:40.690
Your flames won't work against me!

05:43.690 --> 05:46.700
Can't swallow them now, can you?

06:01.100 --> 06:02.170
This is bad.

06:02.960 --> 06:05.960
Pervert turtle!

06:10.290 --> 06:13.510
Two members of Team Snake 
have been annihilated!

06:13.510 --> 06:18.120
Fantastic teamwork from 
Yihwa and the red hawk!

06:19.190 --> 06:21.980
Red hawk?

06:22.240 --> 06:26.930
My name is Rak Wraithraiser!

06:26.930 --> 06:29.360
I came to see the black turtle!

06:29.580 --> 06:35.890
I'll pummel every last turtle 
who stands in my way!

06:42.740 --> 06:44.250
Oh, shut up.

06:46.740 --> 06:51.510
Let me ask you something. 
Are you Viole's friends?

06:51.510 --> 06:55.510
That's Beta. How'd he join the match?

06:55.510 --> 06:57.860
Didn't you hear me?

06:57.860 --> 07:00.270
Are you Viole's friends or not?

07:00.270 --> 07:04.600
The black turtle is my prey!

07:04.600 --> 07:05.520
Prey?

07:05.770 --> 07:07.830
A daughter of the honorable Ten Families

07:07.830 --> 07:11.030
would rather die than team 
up with a FUG member!

07:11.030 --> 07:13.590
They said they're not.

07:13.590 --> 07:15.540
<i>That can't be right.</i>

07:15.540 --> 07:19.280
Hurry up and find me some of Viole's friends.

07:19.280 --> 07:24.430
<i>Well, uh, there's someone heading 
to the summoning station nearby.</i>

07:26.210 --> 07:26.990
<i>Wait!</i>

07:27.860 --> 07:29.230
<i>Go after him!</i>

07:29.230 --> 07:31.110
<i>He's the one who trapped Bam!</i>

07:31.110 --> 07:32.420
<i>He's our enemy!</i>

07:32.420 --> 07:33.260
What?!

07:34.470 --> 07:36.720
Can't you run on your own two legs?

07:36.720 --> 07:40.230
Aw, but this is easier.

07:40.230 --> 07:41.730
I swear...

07:42.230 --> 07:45.890
Why are you so desperate anyway, Chirpy?

07:45.890 --> 07:49.990
It shouldn't matter to you 
whether he lives or dies.

07:54.600 --> 07:56.330
Whoops!

07:56.330 --> 07:59.590
It does matter! We're friends!

07:59.590 --> 08:04.750
Believing in friendship in this 
tower will get you killed.

08:04.750 --> 08:06.340
Right?

08:07.720 --> 08:10.420
Now let me burn things as I please.

08:15.820 --> 08:18.050
I'll go once I've finished torching this guy.

08:18.050 --> 08:19.920
You head to the summoning station.

08:20.490 --> 08:21.600
Quaetro...

08:21.600 --> 08:24.720
You listen to me. I'm not helping him.

08:24.720 --> 08:28.480
I'm helping <i>you</i>. Now go.

08:28.730 --> 08:31.120
Fine. Be careful.

08:34.050 --> 08:36.940
Now let's get burning!

08:37.490 --> 08:40.250
<i>Even Quaetro has joined our side.</i>

08:42.030 --> 08:44.850
<i>You've found good friends, Bam.</i>

08:52.030 --> 08:58.020
You're not too bad if you can dodge 
the attacks of the quickest Regular.

08:58.020 --> 08:59.880
The quickest Regular?

08:59.880 --> 09:03.270
Does that mean you're the fastest one here?

09:03.270 --> 09:04.520
Of course.

09:04.520 --> 09:06.580
Then let's test that.

09:06.580 --> 09:07.520
Test me?

09:07.520 --> 09:12.280
Yeah. I'm itching to know how fast I am.

09:12.280 --> 09:14.280
You're only human!

09:14.280 --> 09:17.280
Partial Ignition: Dionysos!

09:31.710 --> 09:32.960
Too slow.

09:34.210 --> 09:36.220
Test complete.

09:40.720 --> 09:43.920
You said you weren't Viole's friends.

09:45.380 --> 09:50.040
I see. But why are they 
so desperate to summon?

09:51.090 --> 09:54.480
I get it. You're planning to summon Viole.

09:55.970 --> 09:58.990
The others are in danger, but I'm stuck here.

10:00.220 --> 10:03.490
What did I get stronger for?

10:03.830 --> 10:05.570
I'm no different from...

10:07.700 --> 10:11.500
back when I simply waited for Rachel to come.

10:12.510 --> 10:15.450
<i>No! I can't just wait for them!</i>

10:24.760 --> 10:27.260
<i>It's taking longer than expected.</i>

10:27.260 --> 10:29.440
<i>There must be a problem above ground.</i>

10:29.440 --> 10:31.020
Reflejo.

10:31.890 --> 10:36.030
You vanished without a word. 
What do you think you're doing?

10:37.080 --> 10:40.030
I wanted to speak with you before the end.

10:40.420 --> 10:42.470
Will you betray us?

10:42.470 --> 10:46.570
You were sent by the elders. 
Why would you do this?

10:47.580 --> 10:50.310
Your methods will bring about destruction.

10:50.530 --> 10:54.480
Destruction? Don't be absurd. 
This is a revolution.

10:54.480 --> 10:57.760
We will acquire the power to kill Jahad.

10:57.760 --> 11:01.300
Our plan cannot be stopped.

11:01.850 --> 11:04.720
Eventually, the solution 
will dissolve that man,

11:04.720 --> 11:08.310
and a weapon with the power 
of an Irregular will be born.

11:08.310 --> 11:13.020
It will be the spear that opens 
the way to a new era in the tower,

11:13.740 --> 11:17.820
in the hands of our great master Karaka.

11:17.820 --> 11:21.640
I can't believe Karaka would do this.

11:22.720 --> 11:27.470
Did he convince himself he could become 
a god because he was revered as one?

11:27.830 --> 11:28.870
What a fool.

11:31.460 --> 11:32.830
What are you doing here?

11:34.980 --> 11:40.010
We knew from the start 
that your gambit was bait,

11:40.490 --> 11:45.100
so we pretended to fall for it and 
gathered allies to rescue Viole.

11:46.040 --> 11:50.570
Why do you think we embedded 
the red Thorn inside his body?

11:51.170 --> 11:52.100
You don't mean...

11:52.100 --> 11:56.110
That's right. He's a vessel 
for empowering Enryu's Thorn.

11:56.860 --> 12:00.940
He's already begun summoning 
it in response to the Thorn.

12:21.820 --> 12:24.980
From the moment you trapped Viole...

12:31.590 --> 12:34.520
the owner of the Thorn had been decided.

12:36.250 --> 12:38.390
Kill her!

12:42.660 --> 12:43.530
She killed herself?

12:43.530 --> 12:45.920
You fool, she's a Guide!

12:45.920 --> 12:47.640
She wouldn't walk the path of death!

12:48.450 --> 12:50.130
What's happening to the Thorn?

12:50.130 --> 12:51.650
Let's see...

12:51.650 --> 12:53.940
Huh? There's no response.

12:54.790 --> 12:56.360
Call the Mad Dog.

12:56.360 --> 12:59.420
Don't let her escape.

13:00.120 --> 13:02.300
More traps?

13:03.190 --> 13:04.770
I hope not.

13:13.920 --> 13:15.990
I knew it. Another trap.

13:20.620 --> 13:23.490
I'll handle this. You go to Viole.

13:41.090 --> 13:41.700
Damn!

13:41.700 --> 13:43.210
Are you done yet?

13:45.000 --> 13:47.740
Hurry up and break it!

13:50.480 --> 13:52.350
Novick, please get out of the way!

13:52.950 --> 13:53.810
That voice...

13:54.100 --> 13:54.980
Get down!

14:19.350 --> 14:22.120
Are you really trying to summon Viole?

14:22.120 --> 14:25.080
Aren't you being a little 
too optimistic? You moron.

14:25.080 --> 14:26.460
What was that?

14:26.460 --> 14:28.730
He can't escape.

14:28.730 --> 14:31.640
I stuck him in a totally hopeless place.

14:32.000 --> 14:33.890
Shrink your body!

14:37.140 --> 14:38.850
Why would you do this?

14:39.110 --> 14:42.360
To make him taste despair.

14:46.680 --> 14:49.680
The black turtle will come back to us!

14:55.440 --> 15:00.100
Do you know how many people 
were sacrificed to create him?

15:00.100 --> 15:04.350
I witnessed countless test subjects die.

15:04.350 --> 15:08.880
I won't allow him alone to find happiness.

15:11.130 --> 15:14.420
Soon he'll completely transform into a weapon

15:14.420 --> 15:17.560
while experiencing the despair I felt.

15:21.760 --> 15:22.730
Did it work?

15:28.030 --> 15:29.670
Fine.

15:29.980 --> 15:32.700
I'll kill you first.

15:34.800 --> 15:36.410
<i>Beta, bad news!</i>

15:36.410 --> 15:38.100
Don't bother me right now.

15:38.100 --> 15:40.170
<i>It's Jue Viole Grace.</i>

15:40.840 --> 15:42.460
<i>He's escaped.</i>

15:43.130 --> 15:44.740
<i>The Thorn has been stolen, too.</i>

15:55.710 --> 15:56.590
Viole!

15:57.070 --> 15:58.840
What are you two doing here?

15:58.840 --> 16:01.440
Yuto guided us here.

16:01.440 --> 16:02.640
Yuto did?

16:02.990 --> 16:05.230
Anyway, what's that?

16:06.650 --> 16:08.420
I believe it's Enryu's Thorn.

16:08.420 --> 16:13.380
That thing? It doesn't look like much.

16:14.310 --> 16:15.740
Well, it is.

16:16.290 --> 16:19.820
It looks like that because 
it's currently contained.

16:20.360 --> 16:25.750
No one knows what it'll do 
once it assumes its true form.

16:27.170 --> 16:29.250
Hwaryun, what are you doing here?

16:29.680 --> 16:31.720
Are you Yuto?

16:31.720 --> 16:34.500
I simply walked Yuto's path

16:34.500 --> 16:37.040
in order to give you Enryu's Thorn.

16:37.960 --> 16:41.300
Then you knew everything from the start?

16:41.300 --> 16:46.900
Yes, including what would happen 
to you at this Workshop Battle.

16:46.900 --> 16:49.390
And you acquired the Thorn.

16:50.400 --> 16:55.490
It seems you're finally worthy of 
being my god, if only a little.

16:56.890 --> 16:59.150
I'm not interested in being your god.

16:59.530 --> 17:02.420
Are you planning to return to your friends?

17:04.030 --> 17:05.730
Then I'll show you the way.

17:06.190 --> 17:09.090
They should be heading 
to the summoning station.

17:09.090 --> 17:10.180
The summoning station?

17:10.910 --> 17:16.240
They'll begin preparing to summon 
you once they get there, but...

17:17.820 --> 17:19.680
The enemy is on the move, as well.

17:20.690 --> 17:25.190
They're nothing like the enemies 
you've faced before.

17:25.190 --> 17:30.190
They'll do whatever it takes 
to stop you from returning.

17:30.710 --> 17:35.170
Trying to return to your friends 
will put them in harm's way.

17:35.170 --> 17:36.700
Will you still do it?

17:36.700 --> 17:40.450
Yes. That's where I belong.

17:42.750 --> 17:45.970
I want to be with them, 
no matter how difficult it is.

17:46.430 --> 17:47.850
I will go back to them.

17:53.130 --> 17:54.460
I'm here.

17:55.220 --> 17:57.460
I have news from Akraptor.

17:57.870 --> 18:00.970
The snake woman headed to 
the summoning station, too.

18:01.760 --> 18:07.630
Listen to me. Bam's escape and the path 
we're about to take will be kept secret.

18:08.270 --> 18:12.730
Turn off everything that could 
be used to trace you. Got it?

18:12.990 --> 18:14.190
Got it.

18:15.130 --> 18:17.740
Now let's summon Viole.

18:18.950 --> 18:20.690
You're leaving already?

18:22.630 --> 18:24.870
You should stay a while longer.

18:25.220 --> 18:29.690
Reflejo told me to stop 
you from leaving, too.

18:31.460 --> 18:33.490
What are those dogs?

18:33.490 --> 18:34.620
Shadow wolves.

18:34.930 --> 18:38.320
It's a unique Mad Dog ability 
granted by blood fusion.

18:38.320 --> 18:44.640
Normally they're invisible, but they 
appear momentarily when they attack.

18:44.640 --> 18:47.520
Then if we kill the leader of the pack...

18:47.870 --> 18:50.700
He's a monster designed to kill.

18:50.700 --> 18:52.700
Don't even think about fighting him.

18:53.140 --> 18:56.000
Our goal is to escape.

19:04.370 --> 19:05.770
Ignore what's behind you.

19:06.110 --> 19:07.870
I'll guide them out of here.

19:08.460 --> 19:12.260
Unless you and the Thorn are summoned, 
everything will be for naught.

19:31.320 --> 19:34.520
Looks like you still don't 
know how to use it.

19:34.780 --> 19:37.650
We'd better recover it 
before you become a threat.

19:43.030 --> 19:45.530
Looks like he's joining the fight.

19:48.830 --> 19:49.970
Go.

19:49.970 --> 19:50.820
But...

19:51.390 --> 19:55.290
Have you forgotten that your friends 
are desperately fighting to rescue you?

20:03.800 --> 20:07.220
Oh, my. That was my biggest shield, too.

20:08.280 --> 20:11.180
You seem rather unbothered, dog of Yama.

20:12.020 --> 20:17.190
Isn't Viole heading for the spring linked 
to the teammate summoning station?

20:17.190 --> 20:20.680
Sorry, but we destroyed it.

20:25.820 --> 20:28.580
This had better be the right way.

20:28.580 --> 20:31.800
It is. I confirmed it before 
turning off my device.

20:32.360 --> 20:35.580
We'll summon Viole not from the 
teammate summoning station,

20:35.580 --> 20:37.840
<b>Handsome
Where is Novick?</b>

20:35.580 --> 20:37.840
<b>Emily
He has helped Viole escape.
The summoning will be conducted at the shop (item summoning station).
The item code is SS-1SSA.</b>

20:36.060 --> 20:39.370
but from the item summoning station.

20:40.700 --> 20:44.440
Viole is currently both a human and an item.

20:44.440 --> 20:46.340
We'll use that to our advantage.

20:55.250 --> 20:56.350
Bam...

20:56.350 --> 20:57.760
Viole...

20:57.760 --> 21:01.090
Please, please, please.

21:01.090 --> 21:02.360
<i>Wangnan.</i>

21:02.360 --> 21:05.970
Viole! Are you all right?

21:05.970 --> 21:06.860
<i>Yes.</i>

21:07.330 --> 21:10.720
I see. You're okay. Sorry.

21:11.650 --> 21:15.500
Oh, right. Khun's here, too. He's in here.

21:16.300 --> 21:17.350
<i>Khun!</i>

21:18.650 --> 21:21.880
Looks like you won't be running anymore.

21:22.180 --> 21:22.880
I won't.

21:24.950 --> 21:27.870
There's so much I want to tell you.

21:27.870 --> 21:29.850
So much has happened.

21:30.470 --> 21:33.640
Your expression has softened.

21:34.810 --> 21:37.220
Okay, just wait a little longer.

21:37.610 --> 21:41.130
We can summon you once we've 
caught the snake woman.

21:45.460 --> 21:46.390
Wangnan?

21:49.460 --> 21:51.860
Who are you gonna summon?

21:54.640 --> 21:58.250
I won't let you do that.

22:00.710 --> 22:02.000
Wangnan!

23:36.970 --> 23:37.910
What's that?

23:37.910 --> 23:39.010
Dried bonito?

23:39.040 --> 23:41.250
<b>Next Time
The End of Dawn</b>
